{"questionUid":"qid_v1_58e924e1b4efb1a61e4cc1d8ceeef78866499dbdf6185a31d533d4a20b81d55d","sourceArchiveFile":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js","sourceOrdinal":1,"sourceQuestionNo":"1","sourceIdentity":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js#1","sourceFingerprint":"6fedeffda0b3a2e6dc0b069c4d820dc61b93524bfbcfe848e448ec7eac02a05a","sourceIdentityFingerprint":"e3e8b14a6cf237862ca6d1e93b07a0fa59ff2ba5954363609cfa9f36e6f31edb","content":"다음 기본도형에 대한 설명으로 옳지 않은 것은? [3점]","choices":["점, 선, 면은 도형을 이루는 기본요소이다.","선은 무수히 많은 점들로 이루어져 있다.","선과 선이 만나 생기는 점을 교각이라고 한다.","두 점을 잇는 선 중 가장 짧은 선은 선분이다.","선분 $AB$ 위의 점 $M$에 대하여 $\\overline{AM}=\\overline{MB}$일 때, 점 $M$을 선분 $AB$의 중점이라고 한다."],"answer":"③","solution":"③은 틀린 설명이다. 두 직선이 한 점에서 만나면 교각은 네 개 생기며, 마주 보는 두 각씩이 맞꼭지각을 이룬다. 따라서 교각이 두 개라는 설명은 옳지 않다.","images":[],"contentHash":"9e6d675354173395b828cc8d6f369d3d810d21fd32e6d746886711b9a3281cfe","choicesHash":"b3a1ebfe301b8f8320a450b948697969cc8bcd516303448243411bbf8655ecd6","solutionHash":"7361eab7435642fed873a7069d24cabb0969c24a1769a4f30dc1cf5e5afb5abc","currentL1":"M1-05","currentL2":"M1-05-BASIC_FIGURE","standardCourse":"중1 수학","inputFieldInventory":["questionUid","sourceArchiveFile","sourceOrdinal","sourceQuestionNo","sourceIdentity","sourceFingerprint","sourceIdentityFingerprint","content","choices","answer","solution","images","contentHash","choicesHash","solutionHash","currentL1","currentL2","standardCourse"],"inputBundleSha":"3adb78229d6b5954e1edf853ab697a3c96cdc0692e42111bfc133b9a855145de"}
{"questionUid":"qid_v1_e511e1acc4c973487258c0ce08b416d748f5f216d2254a80c440f03a5ca475b6","sourceArchiveFile":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js","sourceOrdinal":2,"sourceQuestionNo":"2","sourceIdentity":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js#2","sourceFingerprint":"23087d96e73754782e56e23134f2a027f7bc428b14e1c52210760105bfbfe0a2","sourceIdentityFingerprint":"7c761b76740a1625db3762a67f00e292c06e0f8921c5ee8d8902b14c9fa89109","content":"아래 그림과 같이 네 점 $A$, $B$, $C$, $D$가 직선 $l$ 위에 있을 때, 다음 보기 중에서 같은 것끼리 바르게 짝 지어진 것을 고르시오. [4점]<div class=\"note-box\">ㄱ. $\\overline{AB}$, $\\overline{BA}$　ㄴ. $\\overrightarrow{AB}$, $\\overrightarrow{BA}$　ㄷ. $\\overleftrightarrow{AC}$, $\\overleftrightarrow{BD}$</div>","choices":["ㄱ","ㄴ","ㄱ, ㄴ","ㄱ, ㄷ","ㄱ, ㄴ, ㄷ"],"answer":"④","solution":"선분은 양 끝점을 바꾸어도 같은 선분이므로 AB와 BA는 같다. 반직선은 시작점과 방향이 정해지므로 AB와 BA는 다르다. A, C, B, D가 같은 직선 위에 있으므로 직선 AC와 BD는 같다. 따라서 ㄱ, ㄷ인 ④이다.","images":[{"ref":"assets/images/23_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출/q2.png","exists":true,"sha256":"053fe32ea2c97df9caecad3469281637fa41b962c4db001e4331212f4654f700"}],"contentHash":"2de0ca30ba9299c3693eefb5bc24fa1deec43c20a00c4a6d795f0816c15eeb50","choicesHash":"e54d8db8191f26aed7363638450ff6473a2e8954c8670271aaa36beac12bc1cb","solutionHash":"d1e3c9b8301d19b8bb6c409c9dd1dc8323289412584853840d2132e0f6c3e387","currentL1":"M1-05","currentL2":"M1-05-BASIC_FIGURE","standardCourse":"중1 수학","inputFieldInventory":["questionUid","sourceArchiveFile","sourceOrdinal","sourceQuestionNo","sourceIdentity","sourceFingerprint","sourceIdentityFingerprint","content","choices","answer","solution","images","contentHash","choicesHash","solutionHash","currentL1","currentL2","standardCourse"],"inputBundleSha":"5db3725e5f6f5f8e612ec92df9b0260141114416668114cd6214ea1d87bbd307"}
{"questionUid":"qid_v1_0c81294b8cce9244b4db23db53e73bc3eed28d7b8b94d0b3550f92deacf0fb94","sourceArchiveFile":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js","sourceOrdinal":3,"sourceQuestionNo":"3","sourceIdentity":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js#3","sourceFingerprint":"b08c1964173533bff81c43538038b591fc55cb140571adfd606377e7184db4a1","sourceIdentityFingerprint":"579f3519c92f59d4764b64b4a5cc7bbdc00359f88fc2567023920848263537f6","content":"점 $M$은 선분 $AB$의 중점이고, 점 $N$은 선분 $AM$의 중점이다. $\\overline{AB}=16\\,\\mathrm{cm}$일 때, $\\overline{NM}$의 길이를 구하면? [4점]","choices":["$2\\,\\mathrm{cm}$","$4\\,\\mathrm{cm}$","$6\\,\\mathrm{cm}$","$8\\,\\mathrm{cm}$","$10\\,\\mathrm{cm}$"],"answer":"②","solution":"M은 AB의 중점이므로 AM=16÷2=8 cm이다. N은 AM의 중점이므로 NM=8÷2=4 cm이다.","images":[{"ref":"assets/images/23_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출/q3.png","exists":true,"sha256":"d05e38769d713876b74de0eec564cc15b1469e89b9ddf360170f8c4277d6aa7e"}],"contentHash":"a82a2dec1f11d01c8e87c2a7e879461992ab7aca5de20ba08b252c5db4e3c187","choicesHash":"44a6042ea764d9f7059d0ccacb382200395931021188c98fbbfb225178d39fe1","solutionHash":"72c6857d20837e65cf55fb016f4675314e26b9ee2bea857812033fe05a795baa","currentL1":"M1-05","currentL2":"M1-05-BASIC_FIGURE","standardCourse":"중1 수학","inputFieldInventory":["questionUid","sourceArchiveFile","sourceOrdinal","sourceQuestionNo","sourceIdentity","sourceFingerprint","sourceIdentityFingerprint","content","choices","answer","solution","images","contentHash","choicesHash","solutionHash","currentL1","currentL2","standardCourse"],"inputBundleSha":"5b0dd2c86b93aa78daf044089ebf3786006951331ed3673eafa315148eacf1ff"}
{"questionUid":"qid_v1_e0749b87e3a770a0f5e83582b65e478c605c99b9cf09f9c55c1b49c24a18fc2c","sourceArchiveFile":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js","sourceOrdinal":4,"sourceQuestionNo":"4","sourceIdentity":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js#4","sourceFingerprint":"4d848d3bd4303f4d106f2364a9a6ced12432db4b90a040abea5ee6f4393378ba","sourceIdentityFingerprint":"a6d9784cee7d9665da9acea655755246431b0a034d923c1f5b47ed2760d5ca1d","content":"다음 각에 대한 설명으로 옳지 않은 것은? [4점]","choices":["맞꼭지각의 크기는 서로 같다.","직각은 평각의 크기의 $\\dfrac12$이다.","예각은 크기가 $0^\\circ$보다 크고 $90^\\circ$보다 작은 각이다.","둔각은 크기가 $90^\\circ$보다 크고 $180^\\circ$보다 작은 각이다.","두 직선이 한 점에서 만날 때 두 개의 교각이 생긴다."],"answer":"⑤","solution":"두 직선이 한 점에서 만나면 교각은 네 개가 생긴다. 나머지 설명은 각의 정의에 맞으므로 옳지 않은 것은 ⑤이다.","images":[],"contentHash":"0e2a422466b42c342ba5189c1fe7bc563edfaf447ac376f6387741342d867825","choicesHash":"b166279494f45d44bb752d750d9218135fa0197187b79983d6da55718ab386d2","solutionHash":"cda3869f11ec287e667da8d8ee645bf23cae2052b86bccb47197e11afab68d1d","currentL1":"M1-05","currentL2":"M1-05-BASIC_FIGURE","standardCourse":"중1 수학","inputFieldInventory":["questionUid","sourceArchiveFile","sourceOrdinal","sourceQuestionNo","sourceIdentity","sourceFingerprint","sourceIdentityFingerprint","content","choices","answer","solution","images","contentHash","choicesHash","solutionHash","currentL1","currentL2","standardCourse"],"inputBundleSha":"87601882722ceb97d98011d47b6ba5fa797246d8eea572f6cbd3568b141220d6"}
{"questionUid":"qid_v1_d9b5f517ec7d835e268907efa584f2f4672109ee5a366630eb35d14f98d069bc","sourceArchiveFile":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js","sourceOrdinal":5,"sourceQuestionNo":"5","sourceIdentity":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js#5","sourceFingerprint":"6d6adcceab89508d24fd9d87471caa79d135297f072d8b3e0b984693709b46a7","sourceIdentityFingerprint":"7aeb727cc13fb8c8c7aa8062279866fb1fe17217a6b2a825e8c98a3dcc81491d","content":"아래 직육면체에서 점 $A$에서 $\\overline{BC}$에 내린 수선의 발을 고르면? [4점]","choices":["점 $A$","점 $B$","점 $C$","점 $D$","점 $E$"],"answer":"②","solution":"직육면체에서 AB와 BC는 꼭짓점 B에서 만나는 서로 수직인 모서리이다. 따라서 A에서 직선 BC에 내린 수선은 AB이고 수선의 발은 B이다.","images":[{"ref":"assets/images/23_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출/q5.png","exists":true,"sha256":"2ca6c1d712359b2f9721441d0f815b2c5d45e2a99aa1f1dd2467f4df702414e6"}],"contentHash":"583adb75839aa184a15bedd925284f0d4ca816e58e30d0be32adfd9bf3ae312a","choicesHash":"447d620eab386d08235fdfff1c045599bde1efa12e946716a13af51a2321fe58","solutionHash":"59e7f6649c25931895ecebff3780b068886cd8be6eaeac7b130cd652854f44d3","currentL1":"M1-07","currentL2":"M1-07-SOLID_FIGURE","standardCourse":"중1 수학","inputFieldInventory":["questionUid","sourceArchiveFile","sourceOrdinal","sourceQuestionNo","sourceIdentity","sourceFingerprint","sourceIdentityFingerprint","content","choices","answer","solution","images","contentHash","choicesHash","solutionHash","currentL1","currentL2","standardCourse"],"inputBundleSha":"06ce50512d4baa486cc6248c41214bc39834eb870a0faae25ae6fb4150a65b00"}
{"questionUid":"qid_v1_83779527fffc7efb3eeb23ad1c9569dc500651968a2cb1a086dba2e5a20b5353","sourceArchiveFile":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js","sourceOrdinal":6,"sourceQuestionNo":"6","sourceIdentity":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js#6","sourceFingerprint":"f9abab54b14c90919aa158c075fb2ca76ad47f13cfd0b6fc300ca43c3d2cda85","sourceIdentityFingerprint":"c1ee33553d77f439063c1902494e0bc5a299911edaa163e30511e9485ea63f5d","content":"다음 중 공간에서 두 직선의 위치 관계가 아닌 것은? [4점]","choices":["한 점에서 만난다.","일치한다.","평행하다.","포함된다.","꼬인 위치에 있다."],"answer":"④","solution":"공간에서 두 직선의 위치 관계는 한 점에서 만남, 일치, 평행, 꼬인 위치의 네 가지이다. ‘포함된다’는 두 직선의 위치 관계가 아니므로 ④이다.","images":[],"contentHash":"f8a2f595fa51151445867b7a8287e9c416ed3152876ec56115066695923c0ebc","choicesHash":"cb03a619faff33b3a8ff14fe73a90e2b36ba45314091335663bfd96bb4d6d263","solutionHash":"3b646e76d3e0dbd737b8ab6360852235e40148f11456c92937f5334149dadc2e","currentL1":"M1-07","currentL2":"M1-07-SOLID_FIGURE","standardCourse":"중1 수학","inputFieldInventory":["questionUid","sourceArchiveFile","sourceOrdinal","sourceQuestionNo","sourceIdentity","sourceFingerprint","sourceIdentityFingerprint","content","choices","answer","solution","images","contentHash","choicesHash","solutionHash","currentL1","currentL2","standardCourse"],"inputBundleSha":"d7d99acf4919a6577325ef513f562b3e3fcf56733530d9f0ced06e81e89e0cfa"}
{"questionUid":"qid_v1_fc2ead11b5e2bb900a94b558e5cda55cc4916a6af95e0b663b630034915e5e93","sourceArchiveFile":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js","sourceOrdinal":7,"sourceQuestionNo":"7","sourceIdentity":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js#7","sourceFingerprint":"677b00fa8fc721f9376bc56a5edc525acd12ee0271f8e1588b166780dfc731c0","sourceIdentityFingerprint":"d8680ee6c2c05fc6299a219b7b1b196475c8e3b78aebfd76bfce6db6a8703132","content":"다음 도형에서 선분 $AB$와 꼬인 위치에 있는 선분의 개수를 고르면? [4점]","choices":["$5$개","$6$개","$7$개","$8$개","$9$개"],"answer":"③","solution":"선분 AB와 만나거나 AB와 평행한 선분은 꼬인 위치가 아니다. 그림의 선분을 이 기준으로 확인하면 AB와 만나지도 평행하지도 않고 같은 평면에도 놓이지 않는 선분이 7개 남는다. 따라서 ③이다.","images":[{"ref":"assets/images/23_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출/q7.png","exists":true,"sha256":"d25b4d9dab143ad99fea6e5974bcfddb5eaf315bd767cf2d816682c3f65752bd"}],"contentHash":"8e8cda744bdaf027adeb28b3733b3efdc4bd09f7fef98800ffa90bce7dd4a81f","choicesHash":"cf87ed3da3360de8c9daf10cdb1adb78fb6f8a71e6a90b634dde0c1828f1f8a7","solutionHash":"f1a4ebde7cd846df457abc16069d028ce74b77826faaa7285d8f432096feee8a","currentL1":"M1-07","currentL2":"M1-07-SOLID_FIGURE","standardCourse":"중1 수학","inputFieldInventory":["questionUid","sourceArchiveFile","sourceOrdinal","sourceQuestionNo","sourceIdentity","sourceFingerprint","sourceIdentityFingerprint","content","choices","answer","solution","images","contentHash","choicesHash","solutionHash","currentL1","currentL2","standardCourse"],"inputBundleSha":"620e55326becf414c683e19a2d40e4aae4b97b12cec8c3bafec776c5e1df72a2"}
{"questionUid":"qid_v1_3d7ecd300aa4b5ec09218476f24020e4a20eac55acf786c061e02baa91296ce9","sourceArchiveFile":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js","sourceOrdinal":8,"sourceQuestionNo":"8","sourceIdentity":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js#8","sourceFingerprint":"4f919e9ea060c2d5f13e83ba61421dd85fb0eb9dd5407bb300119a1b86d52ac7","sourceIdentityFingerprint":"896549277d953c1836fdaca84bd57861d224654641af4ad00519ba7fc7cab236","content":"다음 그림에서 $\\angle AOB$는 평각이고 $\\angle AOC=4\\angle COD$, $\\angle BOE=4\\angle DOE$일 때, $\\angle COE$의 크기를 구하시오. [4점]","choices":["$30^\\circ$","$36^\\circ$","$45^\\circ$","$60^\\circ$","$72^\\circ$"],"answer":"②","solution":"∠COD=t, ∠DOE=u라 하자. AOB가 평각이므로 4t+t+u+4u=180°, 즉 t+u=36°이다. 구하는 ∠COE=t+u=36°이므로 ②이다.","images":[{"ref":"assets/images/23_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출/q8.png","exists":true,"sha256":"0905d85798f7bae0443936da1cb8b8bb8c1e9e07d39eb26838c2c7ed0499b10d"}],"contentHash":"9570e43cf89a60b767ed2766a2d7c488375a5d677cd221b445bc1d0f0c3e0770","choicesHash":"086143d1fb73316a2a60ba782bca9c88bf23dd6932a38575de69ed30d1674d0a","solutionHash":"9a18d3e3dd024bddbe1e7120a60ac38870944c8f34cd4f0beda30b0d9e65fcd5","currentL1":"M1-05","currentL2":"M1-05-BASIC_FIGURE","standardCourse":"중1 수학","inputFieldInventory":["questionUid","sourceArchiveFile","sourceOrdinal","sourceQuestionNo","sourceIdentity","sourceFingerprint","sourceIdentityFingerprint","content","choices","answer","solution","images","contentHash","choicesHash","solutionHash","currentL1","currentL2","standardCourse"],"inputBundleSha":"0d7edf119fcf2f3f54663a250f07ee938195daa0c3153373cfa6a54057d86147"}
{"questionUid":"qid_v1_0b8ebbbe9e54823d19d70892c9dbfa37c03ade418e486bcbe8a821c3daeab754","sourceArchiveFile":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js","sourceOrdinal":9,"sourceQuestionNo":"9","sourceIdentity":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js#9","sourceFingerprint":"523a833e320d2e8e6f510f30540bbe2714f228365573b100ee6ae80a58255d41","sourceIdentityFingerprint":"34a2b91bc6d293cdd7161d58a245134e79ded180adf9fd12b3dc4c83d6f1fd00","content":"다음 보기 중에서 공간에 있는 두 직선이 서로 평행한 것을 모두 고른 것은? (단, 일치하는 경우는 제외한다.) [4점]<div class=\"note-box\">ㄱ. 한 평면에 수직인 두 직선　ㄴ. 한 직선에 평행한 두 직선<br>ㄷ. 한 평면에 평행한 두 직선　ㄹ. 한 직선에 수직인 두 직선</div>","choices":["ㄱ, ㄴ","ㄱ, ㄷ","ㄱ, ㄹ","ㄴ, ㄹ","ㄷ, ㄹ"],"answer":"①","solution":"한 평면에 수직인 두 직선은 서로 평행하고(ㄱ), 한 직선에 평행한 두 직선도 서로 평행하다(ㄴ). 한 평면에 평행하거나 한 직선에 수직인 것만으로는 평행을 보장하지 않는다. 따라서 ㄱ, ㄴ인 ①이다.","images":[],"contentHash":"68cfcca9c1fb129cf6d9548dc4ae5598960fdff394a9b57accb22e4e6f6a20fd","choicesHash":"9238b37b5ee679feee00cbf5115bfd572ab9d1aac200325a70d14911db955d30","solutionHash":"2350543f9286da58028811c001db9e542aa7e7e553abbbf236554c7c845f446d","currentL1":"M1-07","currentL2":"M1-07-SOLID_FIGURE","standardCourse":"중1 수학","inputFieldInventory":["questionUid","sourceArchiveFile","sourceOrdinal","sourceQuestionNo","sourceIdentity","sourceFingerprint","sourceIdentityFingerprint","content","choices","answer","solution","images","contentHash","choicesHash","solutionHash","currentL1","currentL2","standardCourse"],"inputBundleSha":"7a1dbf45c0776195627caffe7ef687856b9a49cb0a6bdd6f41792083e08e8cc2"}
{"questionUid":"qid_v1_98cfbc3714e72da3018c6dfd4df8336bd847096e032efc6afced70c7bcab28d3","sourceArchiveFile":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js","sourceOrdinal":10,"sourceQuestionNo":"10","sourceIdentity":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js#10","sourceFingerprint":"83b82af44004cdb96325525dc508bbded97474039c04848ffe876727604b547c","sourceIdentityFingerprint":"d45a0c7cf4f402ebe9733eacaa1233a2f73b1c8453c87e0f34f3a92ae611d07f","content":"아래 그림에서 $l\\parallel m$일 때, $\\angle x-\\angle y$의 값을 구하시오. [5점]","choices":["$50^\\circ$","$55^\\circ$","$60^\\circ$","$65^\\circ$","$70^\\circ$"],"answer":"④","solution":"l과 m은 평행하므로 각 선분의 방향을 같은 수평선에 대하여 비교한다. 왼쪽 선분의 35°와 130°인 꼭짓점의 방향 관계를 쓰면 가운데 하강 선분은 왼쪽 상승 선분보다 50° 방향이 작다. 오른쪽 150° 조건으로 꼭짓점 각의 방향을 정리하면 x=β+100°, y=β+35°가 되어 x−y=65°이다. 따라서 ④이다.","images":[{"ref":"assets/images/23_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출/q10.png","exists":true,"sha256":"3f24de013ee647d1795598370bc608e4cd64530c7fb78e99f7bf0bef2f5a5047"}],"contentHash":"21656f05df79974e903840ace0f6df8494f289ee83780d81757892585579c5f4","choicesHash":"00460a4772b6e334a694ebe48399c87579ff2e7d90866211fa7cea8dbd3a4ee2","solutionHash":"b4be123faeef9015cd6e217ae9f304ff3934c74ece8e30532e1dac16fd9e9cbb","currentL1":"M1-05","currentL2":"M1-05-POSITION_RELATION","standardCourse":"중1 수학","inputFieldInventory":["questionUid","sourceArchiveFile","sourceOrdinal","sourceQuestionNo","sourceIdentity","sourceFingerprint","sourceIdentityFingerprint","content","choices","answer","solution","images","contentHash","choicesHash","solutionHash","currentL1","currentL2","standardCourse"],"inputBundleSha":"86099031728f91f9243baef721acf595e5572119a7bf84bf4250f0f57e8be15a"}
{"questionUid":"qid_v1_a571e0208b75f118764e822827ebcadaeb47c1606dd1c045ed6f3f55aec70895","sourceArchiveFile":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js","sourceOrdinal":11,"sourceQuestionNo":"11","sourceIdentity":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js#11","sourceFingerprint":"a2cede0f0dccb49d847b523ed7dc4d264d007c08ae961267aaebb94eb6e85646","sourceIdentityFingerprint":"f3258a0dd454a73bda9c9985023ee8716b4aa4b42bf455558cdcf07924fd898e","content":"아래 그림은 $\\angle AOB$와 크기가 같은 각을 $\\overrightarrow{O'X}$를 한 변으로 하여 작도한 것이다. 다음 중 작도 가능한 순서를 올바르게 나타낸 것을 고르면? [3점]","choices":[],"answer":"①","solution":"각을 복사할 때는 원래 꼭짓점 O를 중심으로 호를 그려 두 변과의 교점을 잡고, 같은 반지름의 호를 O′에서 그린다. 원래 호의 두 교점 사이 현의 길이를 새 호에 옮긴 뒤 O′와 그 교점을 잇는다. 그림의 기호 순서가 이 표준 작도 순서와 일치하는 것은 ①이다.","images":[{"ref":"assets/images/23_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출/q11.png","exists":true,"sha256":"e022d9fe4d510af56e77c51ffaf75288b8214fa2dd84f8dc562a475b6eb33c6b"}],"contentHash":"5d66da1df62391d6b7ceb1b39ecf5173541eb308dbfd096b29749003cb95b987","choicesHash":"4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945","solutionHash":"4c3ba1c265c233137b39aeb9b72771776e37ff50e0dbfb266f27cd1aa9e4669c","currentL1":"M1-05","currentL2":"M1-05-BASIC_FIGURE","standardCourse":"중1 수학","inputFieldInventory":["questionUid","sourceArchiveFile","sourceOrdinal","sourceQuestionNo","sourceIdentity","sourceFingerprint","sourceIdentityFingerprint","content","choices","answer","solution","images","contentHash","choicesHash","solutionHash","currentL1","currentL2","standardCourse"],"inputBundleSha":"72ad0906ef5c76d687b482d322fee195cc5494c3e4d9719dcb46556734893e85"}
{"questionUid":"qid_v1_84af768ddb3b17d734bd6f0a01a3c24401cb84f5f93aa707cdf673021f1a7278","sourceArchiveFile":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js","sourceOrdinal":12,"sourceQuestionNo":"12","sourceIdentity":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js#12","sourceFingerprint":"989f222517f43b7c2f198676b343f69c5b2af46ccd8ce7c17dacf9e93117e828","sourceIdentityFingerprint":"7cb2f885baa4ab2407accfbfbe1beb140e706959ab7781c0cc2d64313b3816b1","content":"다음 중 $\\triangle ABC$가 하나로 정해지는 것을 고르면? [3점]","choices":["$\\angle A=35^\\circ$, $\\angle B=70^\\circ$, $\\angle C=75^\\circ$","$\\overline{AB}=3\\,\\mathrm{cm}$, $\\overline{BC}=4\\,\\mathrm{cm}$, $\\angle C=80^\\circ$","$\\overline{AB}=3\\,\\mathrm{cm}$, $\\overline{BC}=9\\,\\mathrm{cm}$, $\\overline{CA}=5\\,\\mathrm{cm}$","$\\overline{AB}=2\\,\\mathrm{cm}$, $\\overline{CA}=7\\,\\mathrm{cm}$, $\\angle C=130^\\circ$","$\\overline{AB}=5\\,\\mathrm{cm}$, $\\angle A=20^\\circ$, $\\angle C=110^\\circ$"],"answer":"⑤","solution":"한 변과 그 양 끝의 두 각이 주어지면 ASA 또는 AAS 조건으로 삼각형이 하나로 정해진다. ⑤는 AB=5 cm, ∠A=20°, ∠C=110°이므로 이에 해당한다. 나머지는 각만 주어졌거나 SSA 조건이어서 하나로 정해지지 않는다.","images":[],"contentHash":"13c9a5adaa19524f9b44773b0ae3956815d72a0321aa9109ebccc205e653c0a5","choicesHash":"570729b1d754a8ee57d92ee88ad26d43257f171798e57bf6ea5d57bd79481594","solutionHash":"ae00bf5047505893ce42fa5579751bcd05d78d52cd1d850054345299d2ea0c8f","currentL1":"M1-05","currentL2":"M1-05-BASIC_FIGURE","standardCourse":"중1 수학","inputFieldInventory":["questionUid","sourceArchiveFile","sourceOrdinal","sourceQuestionNo","sourceIdentity","sourceFingerprint","sourceIdentityFingerprint","content","choices","answer","solution","images","contentHash","choicesHash","solutionHash","currentL1","currentL2","standardCourse"],"inputBundleSha":"c3f42f82208428f51f697066961dfa4cda386a4544b1ee70f1e352a647037c67"}
{"questionUid":"qid_v1_ea1c02c0fc4a3a302541009cdbfdb2e8536ee43bdbda2338742b80857a9eb33a","sourceArchiveFile":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js","sourceOrdinal":13,"sourceQuestionNo":"13","sourceIdentity":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js#13","sourceFingerprint":"5a0d0858f2e7c102d9f70ccf4e58ff99a803da115fd1d16851c7e2b0a822cc12","sourceIdentityFingerprint":"26c6d7b1680c5c3d8f15c4292449eee4a33be0bbdd3f6b2feda728ec71fa75c9","content":"아래 그림에서 $\\overline{OA}=\\overline{OC}$, $\\overline{AB}=\\overline{CD}$일 때, $\\triangle AOD$와 $\\triangle COB$는 서로 합동이다. 두 삼각형이 합동임을 설명하기 위해 이용할 수 있는 삼각형의 합동 조건으로 가장 적절한 것을 고르면? [4점]","choices":["SSS","RHS","ASA","RHA","SAS"],"answer":"⑤","solution":"A와 B가 O에서 일직선이고 C와 D도 O에서 일직선이므로 OB=OA+AB, OD=OC+CD이다. OA=OC, AB=CD에서 OB=OD를 얻는다. 또 ∠AOD와 ∠COB는 맞꼭지각이고 OA=OC이므로 두 변과 그 끼인각이 각각 같아 SAS 합동이다. 따라서 ⑤이다.","images":[{"ref":"assets/images/23_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출/q13.png","exists":true,"sha256":"1f19a8148d2b24d09ab339da25412c185fda720576598a0fbb5f66b551432106"}],"contentHash":"03a4a3d6e59a5634c5d90cdfaf7f949439b141db3c9fbbb4de9cb8f17ba2dcac","choicesHash":"5fb686cb81213d85f06cac8662621808b793719cc0878e65c054d427c5e13007","solutionHash":"2fc1e73c6a0213e9226c41d5a00bfddc9eb02d8ebd061a273e1a12f5b7cb4f5a","currentL1":"M1-05","currentL2":"M1-05-BASIC_FIGURE","standardCourse":"중1 수학","inputFieldInventory":["questionUid","sourceArchiveFile","sourceOrdinal","sourceQuestionNo","sourceIdentity","sourceFingerprint","sourceIdentityFingerprint","content","choices","answer","solution","images","contentHash","choicesHash","solutionHash","currentL1","currentL2","standardCourse"],"inputBundleSha":"39eb109e0ee8b753c2f223d6b64ac8cc1cefb4c60087259e0a65810d1b76650c"}
{"questionUid":"qid_v1_3d02ddc05460c2f4ecc679ccbf597d4e55e170cf21ecdda8df64e0f0756c94c8","sourceArchiveFile":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js","sourceOrdinal":14,"sourceQuestionNo":"14","sourceIdentity":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js#14","sourceFingerprint":"b3bbfd7bbafe2286cf85f0023778fb6dba106b1976e215282a9822937b04da8d","sourceIdentityFingerprint":"42acf050e20139e63c789870926c08a880c96029ec820d7c61f4e33531543788","content":"아래 그림과 같이 정사각형 $ABCD$의 변 $BC$를 한 변으로 하는 정삼각형 $BCE$가 있다. $\\overline{BC}=8\\,\\mathrm{cm}$이라고 할 때, $\\triangle ABE$의 넓이를 구하면? [4점]","choices":["$16\\,\\mathrm{cm}^2$","$18\\,\\mathrm{cm}^2$","$20\\,\\mathrm{cm}^2$","$22\\,\\mathrm{cm}^2$","$24\\,\\mathrm{cm}^2$"],"answer":"①","solution":"정사각형의 한 변은 8 cm이고 정삼각형 BCE의 꼭짓점 E는 BC의 중점 위에 있으므로 E에서 AB까지의 거리는 4 cm이다. 따라서 삼각형 ABE의 넓이는 1/2×8×4=16 cm²이고 ①이다.","images":[{"ref":"assets/images/23_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출/q14.png","exists":true,"sha256":"b4554ac67b18ec8432007ee97aff2688fca74d8480f5b32568954c52665f1e04"}],"contentHash":"48c72bcc99922970aaff073b15582959fd5eddf58bb333f15268454c12c1ac85","choicesHash":"d49794623b650e91444a735ce33a0c2fa127064f6572a163d7c7ec8b84fee444","solutionHash":"b8d12cb06e71798be845f2cddc93816de8a09c71bcb7fa9efac7c6b3d9163ca3","currentL1":"M1-05","currentL2":"M1-05-BASIC_FIGURE","standardCourse":"중1 수학","inputFieldInventory":["questionUid","sourceArchiveFile","sourceOrdinal","sourceQuestionNo","sourceIdentity","sourceFingerprint","sourceIdentityFingerprint","content","choices","answer","solution","images","contentHash","choicesHash","solutionHash","currentL1","currentL2","standardCourse"],"inputBundleSha":"ea1fbadc30c624f52e7dd41d5497dc7b52f6f5faf9f6f37a6fc10b0eb358b1f4"}
{"questionUid":"qid_v1_9ef7638fa8442a1fa1e6f90abbd59ee4a197efcb98c1995aff3c5babb8bd1e2c","sourceArchiveFile":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js","sourceOrdinal":15,"sourceQuestionNo":"15","sourceIdentity":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js#15","sourceFingerprint":"c93fcd1fb5380e086c8965667d9ac91f8baa1709fb6abac718053cd7fdbb18d5","sourceIdentityFingerprint":"836bba63e4db1eb378a2bf7d16014a140524e2426b10003e5a6f69af0adbb18e","content":"아래 그림에서 $\\triangle ABC$는 $\\angle A=90^\\circ$이고 $\\overline{AB}=\\overline{AC}$인 직각이등변삼각형이다. 두 꼭짓점 $B$, $C$에서 $\\triangle ABC$의 꼭짓점 $A$를 지나는 직선 $l$ 위에 내린 수선의 발을 각각 $D$, $E$라 하자. $\\overline{DE}=28\\,\\mathrm{cm}$, $\\overline{EC}=7\\,\\mathrm{cm}$일 때, $\\overline{BD}$의 길이를 구하면? [4점]","choices":["$13\\,\\mathrm{cm}$","$15\\,\\mathrm{cm}$","$17\\,\\mathrm{cm}$","$19\\,\\mathrm{cm}$","$21\\,\\mathrm{cm}$"],"answer":"⑤","solution":"수선의 발을 이용하면 직각삼각형 ABD와 ACE가 서로 합동이다. 따라서 AD=CE=7 cm, AE=BD이다. D, A, E가 일직선이고 DE=AD+AE이므로 28=7+BD, BD=21 cm이다. 따라서 ⑤이다.","images":[{"ref":"assets/images/23_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출/q15.png","exists":true,"sha256":"26d034297fc150f260a5aa9e1cfe3b548cf5bb0b0e8d5f8d814b7a10e10d86f8"}],"contentHash":"048ca713ef84cb2518b7a28504b02c2aeb16bcb25816fe9b220edfff378c85c7","choicesHash":"8ac9e83c98db34a50ce13f0a0b472009f45514b85f33dfb63b68360fd82d0b52","solutionHash":"6427daa7a4d693ad506c8a8fb55e9d3f07c969fad2948082784ad0c63a050713","currentL1":"M1-05","currentL2":"M1-05-BASIC_FIGURE","standardCourse":"중1 수학","inputFieldInventory":["questionUid","sourceArchiveFile","sourceOrdinal","sourceQuestionNo","sourceIdentity","sourceFingerprint","sourceIdentityFingerprint","content","choices","answer","solution","images","contentHash","choicesHash","solutionHash","currentL1","currentL2","standardCourse"],"inputBundleSha":"3f0a9ea7fb78ae1a6461d19c9522241eaca48fc2b5407543098beb89ecd2cf6e"}
{"questionUid":"qid_v1_aae8e3d02ffa5d8a77541dd8e9171a112a28ea80b86f80c4f2d7ebeda5f8f994","sourceArchiveFile":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js","sourceOrdinal":16,"sourceQuestionNo":"16","sourceIdentity":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js#16","sourceFingerprint":"5d6027e9a1f5ff89778668d6ba718290866e5deddca2f20637637744fc877ecd","sourceIdentityFingerprint":"ba79916970c346886a9c38a3835cc386030bc5411e8d054fb58e8f10db80ad61","content":"아래 그림에서 $\\angle x$의 크기를 구하면? [4점]","choices":["$40^\\circ$","$48^\\circ$","$62^\\circ$","$67^\\circ$","$75^\\circ$"],"answer":"②","solution":"왼쪽 삼각형의 교점 각은 180°−40°−35°=105°이다. 교차하는 두 직선의 맞꼭지각은 같으므로 오른쪽 삼각형의 교점 각도 105°이다. 따라서 x+27°+105°=180°에서 x=48°이고 ②이다.","images":[{"ref":"assets/images/23_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출/q16.png","exists":true,"sha256":"21238bb6df38423b1bdb43fee99d2a9dadf4602b5c917d3263bf326ef6bbeb0a"}],"contentHash":"278e385f87b4537919f7d42b45d66e9d5d4d939f2c0d956ba6076af8ec6fbb46","choicesHash":"ea33b295290e14fab2a5f807cb919bb76a868aae45f6543cdebb04bd186dbe78","solutionHash":"8727c54e3cf4a7bbb5e4b6657cb4a5680965910e05966d01af3f265e92ee7cc7","currentL1":"M1-05","currentL2":"M1-05-BASIC_FIGURE","standardCourse":"중1 수학","inputFieldInventory":["questionUid","sourceArchiveFile","sourceOrdinal","sourceQuestionNo","sourceIdentity","sourceFingerprint","sourceIdentityFingerprint","content","choices","answer","solution","images","contentHash","choicesHash","solutionHash","currentL1","currentL2","standardCourse"],"inputBundleSha":"1b87d8ee8b495929e35fab6ae301985a405b8780d58a620c91d23545809f87b5"}
{"questionUid":"qid_v1_89a8a97d3c7cf1152abbd4f94130be90be6cf3c78c1dd9d1aafb74cf5fd43c7b","sourceArchiveFile":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js","sourceOrdinal":17,"sourceQuestionNo":"17","sourceIdentity":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js#17","sourceFingerprint":"ceb20fb5f780ca87177bf898f667ba4de65dd10ad847f4381812bffce783fcb3","sourceIdentityFingerprint":"dc41b247db1f85cd89bc13c441f7ae8c05a324e258641c5511dd51f71f762a1f","content":"아래 그림에서 $\\angle a+\\angle b+\\angle c+\\angle d+\\angle e+\\angle f+\\angle g+\\angle h+\\angle i+\\angle j+\\angle k$의 크기를 구하면? [4점]","choices":["$360^\\circ$","$540^\\circ$","$720^\\circ$","$900^\\circ$","$1080^\\circ$"],"answer":"③","solution":"그림의 선분을 따라 생기는 네 개의 삼각형으로 분할하여 각각의 내각의 합을 적용한다. 각 삼각형의 내각 합은 180°이므로 a부터 k까지의 합은 4×180°=720°이다. 따라서 ③이다.","images":[{"ref":"assets/images/23_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출/q17.png","exists":true,"sha256":"0118dedd6f62814fb0c6a32b3ea94b7ff6919118042fcbc90bf56ddf2b871e60"}],"contentHash":"c0c7c19089f77871cf1fd811fcecd853d4174da27c24bf13e57b4f032db020a5","choicesHash":"1e0808f177fe65af1f55ccd008dd6cbbaa5867ebe65eff93c4ac0eca2ebfabd6","solutionHash":"6c347dbb793b028f98b27ed2dbd3cb7a7b5a605b8e88871b514ee08c4e537123","currentL1":"M1-06","currentL2":"M1-06-POLYGON_CIRCLE","standardCourse":"중1 수학","inputFieldInventory":["questionUid","sourceArchiveFile","sourceOrdinal","sourceQuestionNo","sourceIdentity","sourceFingerprint","sourceIdentityFingerprint","content","choices","answer","solution","images","contentHash","choicesHash","solutionHash","currentL1","currentL2","standardCourse"],"inputBundleSha":"6cfbea35f7292c89f6c433426ee8e490fdbe32cfafa42d333ab90edcc1533f1b"}
{"questionUid":"qid_v1_1f83170c9598475023d8ff009183e7e3175cbf1762b58817c46bc07890ffde80","sourceArchiveFile":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js","sourceOrdinal":18,"sourceQuestionNo":"18","sourceIdentity":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js#18","sourceFingerprint":"c6efdad0c65d89bbb901f6f4ddc0620124608daee960b44070e8868e825469a3","sourceIdentityFingerprint":"f2f03811973a5e3e35fba1d17e05c9ce0fca216a8b2137e8eabb1269a5461879","content":"아래 그림은 한 변의 길이가 같은 정팔각형과 정오각형이다. 두 도형의 한 변의 연장선이 만나서 이루어진 각을 $\\angle x$라고 할 때, $\\angle x$의 크기를 구하면? [4점]","choices":["$108^\\circ$","$120^\\circ$","$126^\\circ$","$135^\\circ$","$144^\\circ$"],"answer":"③","solution":"정팔각형의 한 내각은 (8−2)×180°÷8=135°, 정오각형의 한 내각은 (5−2)×180°÷5=108°이다. 두 도형의 변을 연장하여 생기는 각을 그림의 위치에 맞게 직선각과 함께 각의 합으로 정리하면 x=126°가 된다. 따라서 ③이다.","images":[{"ref":"assets/images/23_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출/q18.png","exists":true,"sha256":"d4882688b2f6e8b2a86fe50fdc3d9a15d6e58b4d6730e60bdc072bb5c9dc425f"}],"contentHash":"b40d52559750bea7458a64aa10202999e562751e32d4fdda3d30f17a2ff16b6b","choicesHash":"9657d8b0291927a42fce3aa512a78fb99a811f47a4b993785047afa619d11d8a","solutionHash":"99c43e860d77e6f125ae1ad03159b5af4af6c556ea0d4f8e67ec3714d0711746","currentL1":"M1-06","currentL2":"M1-06-POLYGON_CIRCLE","standardCourse":"중1 수학","inputFieldInventory":["questionUid","sourceArchiveFile","sourceOrdinal","sourceQuestionNo","sourceIdentity","sourceFingerprint","sourceIdentityFingerprint","content","choices","answer","solution","images","contentHash","choicesHash","solutionHash","currentL1","currentL2","standardCourse"],"inputBundleSha":"c4ff4872fa1d1a1d0d1460ca726d22a377a50354ac2bf846570da85a973f4208"}
{"questionUid":"qid_v1_0d4243828ae864211f7ad293fd342424baa6c3e5f739054e7923a32d575089e8","sourceArchiveFile":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js","sourceOrdinal":19,"sourceQuestionNo":"19","sourceIdentity":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js#19","sourceFingerprint":"70a8ef3939d88acdf7051ee30d5b3c7a491ad1e3da0737a9f5c0ce37518ebbfa","sourceIdentityFingerprint":"99476984ac1ea925436127f96b7382482e225981ad9341298db831a6502fad60","content":"한국인 $2$명과 일본인 $3$명, 중국인 $4$명이 국제 회의에서 만나 서로 한 번씩 악수하며 인사했다고 할 때, 악수한 횟수를 구하면? (단, 같은 국적을 가진 사람들끼리는 서로 악수하지 않았다.) [5점]","choices":["$26$회","$27$회","$30$회","$32$회","$36$회"],"answer":"①","solution":"서로 다른 국적끼리만 악수한다. 한국-일본은 2×3=6회, 한국-중국은 2×4=8회, 일본-중국은 3×4=12회이다. 합계는 6+8+12=26회이므로 ①이다.","images":[],"contentHash":"18cf94b55dab5105c42b6fce7ea324fc4e49a6b68b600a93e2d0272cecd04c35","choicesHash":"44465deabc0030e2aa533527445c6c71ee7c0bf376a8f581d0c76f833a459d48","solutionHash":"310c1f4df5ab79a75f95bc0d1c23bdd7d0a43805de73e057b0e2a15959eace19","currentL1":"M2-08","currentL2":"M2-08-PROBABILITY_COUNTING","standardCourse":"중1 수학","inputFieldInventory":["questionUid","sourceArchiveFile","sourceOrdinal","sourceQuestionNo","sourceIdentity","sourceFingerprint","sourceIdentityFingerprint","content","choices","answer","solution","images","contentHash","choicesHash","solutionHash","currentL1","currentL2","standardCourse"],"inputBundleSha":"cf91655cc916f2c9520b85d84fd48dfe1f7c88483c22f3c1bbfe57e878235b9e"}
{"questionUid":"qid_v1_56f87fcf14af7ab287a95d89b4c77abbb8d815221cd55bce76e560b88b8cb16f","sourceArchiveFile":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js","sourceOrdinal":20,"sourceQuestionNo":"20","sourceIdentity":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js#20","sourceFingerprint":"9712a714ca2a142590fb282c5344835fb03f0e9907ead68e9a26811580e5fb1e","sourceIdentityFingerprint":"75a7b2c50f1d9238bd25a1e885a0aa00be2c00c02a1dbef4a920f12436d5fb17","content":"정사각형 $ABCD$에서 $\\overline{BC}$ 위에 점 $E$를 찍고, $\\overline{CD}$ 위에 점 $F$를 찍어 삼각형 $AEF$를 그렸더니 $\\angle EAF=45^\\circ$, $\\angle AFE=80^\\circ$가 되었다고 한다. 이때, $\\angle BAE$의 크기를 구하면? [5점]","choices":["$20^\\circ$","$25^\\circ$","$30^\\circ$","$35^\\circ$","$40^\\circ$"],"answer":"④","solution":"삼각형 AEF에서 ∠AEF=180°−45°−80°=55°이다. 정사각형의 대각선 AC는 꼭짓점 각을 이등분하므로 ∠FAC=∠BAE=x이다. 사인법칙과 정사각형의 직각삼각형에서 AE=s/cos x, AF=s/cos(45°−x)를 사용하면 cos(45°−x)/cos x=sin80°/sin55°=cos10°/cos35°이다. 이를 만족하는 값은 x=35°이므로 ④이다.","images":[{"ref":"assets/images/23_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출/q20.png","exists":true,"sha256":"9e9a38e714300f9b1543e569f3d325707b34df352393fb00361ec429b25a2471"}],"contentHash":"61e03ba16735d9a5dd003b702c147e631eb2b4f3721b0655ff8772ffec8c440f","choicesHash":"3cc51bf2207f493c2bbaaa413e75ce1408c44d48c241d118e443e86277941b29","solutionHash":"21c9481fd61980c7a0f193c655d574636514ceb67537d2f1b13dfcf4b839d703","currentL1":"M1-05","currentL2":"M1-05-BASIC_FIGURE","standardCourse":"중1 수학","inputFieldInventory":["questionUid","sourceArchiveFile","sourceOrdinal","sourceQuestionNo","sourceIdentity","sourceFingerprint","sourceIdentityFingerprint","content","choices","answer","solution","images","contentHash","choicesHash","solutionHash","currentL1","currentL2","standardCourse"],"inputBundleSha":"ce76b20999637531830ecb97b00eefbe3346f6cd3f6b72c598485c2f562605be"}
{"questionUid":"qid_v1_cd50cb80a21017480239a7bc4b0869a81c8ef4b23c78309437ee0d8405bcf363","sourceArchiveFile":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js","sourceOrdinal":21,"sourceQuestionNo":"21","sourceIdentity":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js#21","sourceFingerprint":"46f04b7af8a48b3da4b6ab3c7d294bcb167e9ee9739bafd6d3b1a5a87f778757","sourceIdentityFingerprint":"1f0e68db002315530fda4d371d6a9fc4a9fabbf06fa5a6de8895dce46f73790a","content":"아래 그림에서 $AD\\perp FC$일 때, $x$의 값을 구하고 그 풀이과정을 서술하시오. [5점]","choices":[],"answer":"$15$","solution":"AD⊥FC이므로 ∠AOF=90°이다. 직선 BOE의 위쪽 각을 합하면 (x+20°)+90°+(3x+10°)=180°이다. 따라서 4x+120=180, x=15이다.","images":[{"ref":"assets/images/23_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출/q21.png","exists":true,"sha256":"fce869c9ec827185a0fefa9c467b553e127b33413047d00464d707d2f98be766"}],"contentHash":"8878909bba741b7dfae4ae6bcba86ef7f008fb667e5252eadbdfdcacbdbe2afe","choicesHash":"4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945","solutionHash":"4cc205039a94d83a23358a38a8c8a7b87955d23fbcba3a006234ffbde9fd6a55","currentL1":"M1-05","currentL2":"M1-05-POSITION_RELATION","standardCourse":"중1 수학","inputFieldInventory":["questionUid","sourceArchiveFile","sourceOrdinal","sourceQuestionNo","sourceIdentity","sourceFingerprint","sourceIdentityFingerprint","content","choices","answer","solution","images","contentHash","choicesHash","solutionHash","currentL1","currentL2","standardCourse"],"inputBundleSha":"1080d47b5b9a05737e957cff6b006a9a4fee1c7aa87371e3f1a51ed5e564f356"}
{"questionUid":"qid_v1_9b386d78e9467b658acf1c14f7c0e2fdffac3a54b35a942be7e2bb6b477b04bd","sourceArchiveFile":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js","sourceOrdinal":22,"sourceQuestionNo":"22","sourceIdentity":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js#22","sourceFingerprint":"929f56e729576dd00f4c00a026cfd7c351e2cd83a222828582cbdef3c23ee02a","sourceIdentityFingerprint":"adb955a22468411aefd857d8c3b1086eea7c27b3ad71bddfca1794ae2e646c41","content":"다음 그림에서 $l\\parallel m$일 때, $\\angle x$의 크기를 구하고 그 풀이과정을 서술하시오. [5점]","choices":[],"answer":"$90^\\circ$","solution":"l과 m이 평행하므로 각 선분을 수평선에 대한 방향으로 본다. 위쪽 선분은 수평선과 40°, 아래쪽 선분은 30°를 이룬다. 아래 꺾인 점의 80°를 이용하면 가운데 선분은 수평선과 50°를 이루므로 위 꺾인 점의 각은 x=40°+50°=90°이다.","images":[{"ref":"assets/images/23_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출/q22.png","exists":true,"sha256":"90f4d1c50c63aaf8d412be4003ff0c325f3d464de158df67274fe9233b05f425"}],"contentHash":"2f863bdd6063887b09a37d19d4188d36def2899c3c58b67f5cde6e326e535619","choicesHash":"4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945","solutionHash":"e36b789342385f3f53fd12dd7e999770d1d227499a9fee92ad5ef834694aaa34","currentL1":"M1-05","currentL2":"M1-05-POSITION_RELATION","standardCourse":"중1 수학","inputFieldInventory":["questionUid","sourceArchiveFile","sourceOrdinal","sourceQuestionNo","sourceIdentity","sourceFingerprint","sourceIdentityFingerprint","content","choices","answer","solution","images","contentHash","choicesHash","solutionHash","currentL1","currentL2","standardCourse"],"inputBundleSha":"6cb30e5d9ecbcb08c395ceb20830cfd321353322caa57252a06151171f001a9d"}
{"questionUid":"qid_v1_6305db876ddf39640d44ae07abbf7aa2ac6c519cb285c3e66c839b03e33901fe","sourceArchiveFile":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js","sourceOrdinal":23,"sourceQuestionNo":"23","sourceIdentity":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js#23","sourceFingerprint":"8a8b7a3beeeb5ed17120675ac7809844df2470018b07768274985e35a906d1d4","sourceIdentityFingerprint":"fa348e5b6d19717bd3a337786abe2be7445f5e842f62b7954dc569b1b91d9ad0","content":"다음 중 서로 항상 합동이 아닌 삼각형을 찾고, 합동이 아닌 이유를 서술하시오.<div class=\"note-box\">(a) $\\triangle ABC$: $\\overline{AB}=3\\,\\mathrm{cm}$, $\\overline{BC}=4\\,\\mathrm{cm}$, $\\overline{CA}=5\\,\\mathrm{cm}$<br>$\\triangle DEF$: $\\overline{DE}=5\\,\\mathrm{cm}$, $\\overline{EF}=3\\,\\mathrm{cm}$, $\\overline{FD}=4\\,\\mathrm{cm}$<br>(b) $\\triangle GHI$: $\\overline{GH}=3\\,\\mathrm{cm}$, $\\angle H=45^\\circ$, $\\overline{HI}=6\\,\\mathrm{cm}$<br>$\\triangle JKL$: $\\overline{JK}=6\\,\\mathrm{cm}$, $\\angle K=45^\\circ$, $\\overline{LJ}=3\\,\\mathrm{cm}$<br>(c) $\\triangle MNO$: $\\angle M=45^\\circ$, $\\overline{MN}=6\\,\\mathrm{cm}$, $\\angle N=75^\\circ$<br>$\\triangle PQR$: $\\overline{PQ}=6\\,\\mathrm{cm}$, $\\angle P=45^\\circ$, $\\angle R=60^\\circ$</div> [5점]","choices":[],"answer":"(b)","solution":"(a)는 세 변의 길이가 각각 3, 4, 5 cm로 같으므로 SSS 합동이다. (c)는 두 각과 그 사이의 변이 주어져 ASA 또는 AAS로 합동이 정해진다. (b)는 한 삼각형에서는 두 변과 끼인각이 주어졌지만 다른 삼각형에서는 주어진 각이 두 변의 끼인각이 아니어서 SSA 조건이다. SSA는 서로 다른 삼각형이 가능하므로 항상 합동이 아닌 것은 (b)이다.","images":[],"contentHash":"8ab9a47d07b22907e05ec690f52e3273fff71675dfa90042f43c369ca34b347c","choicesHash":"4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945","solutionHash":"c4c5386b2edf3d9da8dc94561badd2e5a461a251ce77be2237eeba8d2172ad1b","currentL1":"M1-05","currentL2":"M1-05-BASIC_FIGURE","standardCourse":"중1 수학","inputFieldInventory":["questionUid","sourceArchiveFile","sourceOrdinal","sourceQuestionNo","sourceIdentity","sourceFingerprint","sourceIdentityFingerprint","content","choices","answer","solution","images","contentHash","choicesHash","solutionHash","currentL1","currentL2","standardCourse"],"inputBundleSha":"f31d872b75099a27b2e4269b5600e8bf8d084815d799126627c1ba0285033374"}
{"questionUid":"qid_v1_1bc464e0d6f0a8b7e36149efecc79397709aa137fec9820972a2f190214fe8db","sourceArchiveFile":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js","sourceOrdinal":24,"sourceQuestionNo":"24","sourceIdentity":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js#24","sourceFingerprint":"57dad40c5311d06c6da6860d223d3fd127e3648ce2306ddd9f66387f1a327620","sourceIdentityFingerprint":"e46f58ca0d97c16939651bf13ce6781c4988eeafc803cd85cd0e4d22c301cae5","content":"아래 그림에서 $\\angle x$의 크기를 구하고 그 풀이과정을 서술하시오. [5점]","choices":[],"answer":"$20^\\circ$","solution":"오른쪽 꼭짓점의 외각이 4x+40°이므로 내각은 180°−(4x+40°)=140°−4x이다. 삼각형의 내각의 합으로 (85°−2x)+75°+(140°−4x)=180°이므로 6x=120, x=20이다.","images":[{"ref":"assets/images/23_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출/q24.png","exists":true,"sha256":"d163e459a8cf64724f764b6b55ffaa891c995b3dd76eb90c0ba84b1b8010ab54"}],"contentHash":"f810674761a2e5ae62d54c1918b55d5befc2b5cf79d79639303e55df58e72e3a","choicesHash":"4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945","solutionHash":"dee4912a64ca19bef2c85c2fe7f954fcd64740f6f97fcfe71ca6a2eb57116138","currentL1":"M1-05","currentL2":"M1-05-BASIC_FIGURE","standardCourse":"중1 수학","inputFieldInventory":["questionUid","sourceArchiveFile","sourceOrdinal","sourceQuestionNo","sourceIdentity","sourceFingerprint","sourceIdentityFingerprint","content","choices","answer","solution","images","contentHash","choicesHash","solutionHash","currentL1","currentL2","standardCourse"],"inputBundleSha":"9a96161fa44eae4c33e8764549ae0f6a06363d120764c312c2b0a78b76995463"}
